  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0032_fba3db8aa033.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 186px;\"/></p><p>So, the required area is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>8</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
